# TASK-043 evidence subtree: keep the raw bytes.
#
# The repository root `.gitattributes` says `* text=auto eol=lf`, which rewrites
# CRLF files on the way into the index - so a file whose sha256 is written down
# in `INDEX.md` would not be the file the commit actually carries (TASK-042 hit
# exactly this and fixed it the same way). `-text` disables every EOL and
# charset translation for this subtree, so "the committed blob is the bytes
# INDEX.md hashes" is a machine-checkable statement:
#
#   git cat-file blob HEAD:.../evidence/task043/<file> > scratch
#   sha256(scratch) == INDEX.md's value
* -text
